y juice supplement that combines the goodness of juices sourced from different regions of the world to promote healthy living."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"This unique combination of juices contains naturally occurring vitamins, minerals, enzymes, amino acids and a unique profile of antioxidants.\nAcai flourishes in the rainforests and contains powerful antioxidants, omega oils and phytosterols. Mangosteen, known as the Queen of Fruits, contains unique antioxidants called xanthones. Noni has been treasured for hundreds of years by inhabitants of Tahiti and other exotic South Pacific islands and contains Proxeronine which helps the body regulate and provide structure to proteins. Goji berried have been treasured by the Himalayan people for their health properties and the energy that they provide. Camu Camu, native to the Amazon rainforests, is rich in Vitamin C. Maqui berried are grown in the wild in the Patagonia region of South America and contain antioxidants known as anthocyanins. Rounding out this unique formula, we have added Aloe Vera Juice which has been prized for centuries for its unique health properties."},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"Contains no artificial colors or artificial flavors."},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"Natural ingredients in this product can vary the color, taste and consistency from batch to batch. This does not affect potency or quality."},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent disease."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Where health & flavor meet!"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Acai, Mangosteen, Noni, Goji. Camu Camu, Maqui & Aloe Vera"},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"Gluten free"},{"type":"Formulation re: Vegetarian/Vegan","notes":"V\nVegetarian"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"OU (Koshe